e whimsical energy of their silly flok-techno song 'Long Doggul' perfectly. On either side of the stage, oversized inflatable long dogs bob in time with the beat, adding to the playful atmosphere, creating a surreal landscape filled with both music and imagination.", "Captured in a medium 3/4 portrait, Pat of Doggulus pauses rhythmically, embodying the playful spirit of their track 'Long Doggul' amidst a stunning amber and magenta lighting scheme. The performer stands out, their faux-leather suit gleaming warmly as they balance atop stilts, one arm raised dramatically in the air while the joyful audience surrounds in soft focus. The energy is intimate yet invigorating, showcasing Pat's connection to the crowd as the music swells, promising an infectious vibe that is hard to resist.", "A tight close-up hero shot of Pat reveals their playful expression behind oversized sunglasses, truly capturing the essence of Doggulus\u2019 infectious song 'Long Doggul'. Shot from a low angle, the rim lighting highlights their faux-leather suit while a dramatic haze sweeps across the scene. As the final chorus explodes, a surprise confetti shower shaped like long dogs rains down from above, creating a whimsical, theatrical tableau. The framing focuses on Pat against a backdrop of cheerful chaos, perfectly contrasting their confident stance on stilts as the audience goes wild."], "image_url": "/pizzavision/voting/static/generated/08713d3e-f456-4d0e-ae84-d73c1fbee3cb/0.png", "image_chosen_idx": 0, "image_chosen_at": "2026-05-22T21:16:16.809751+00:00"}}}